<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<section xml:id="ch-cs-map" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Computer science major map</title>

  <p>
    The computer science major from the same Bulletin, drawn the same way:
    lower division (mathematics on the left, programming beside it), the four
    required upper-division courses, the four emphases with the courses each one
    names, and the minor. Blue borders mark CSCI courses. Prerequisites for CSEN
    and ECEN courses are set by the School of Engineering and are not drawn.
    <url href="external/cs-major-map.html" visual="">Open full size</url>
    or <url href="external/cs-major-map.pdf" visual="">download as PDF</url>.
  </p>
  <interactive xml:id="cs-major-map" iframe="cs-major-map.html" width="100%" aspect="1920:1240">
    <static><p>Interactive map of the computer science major (available in the HTML version).</p></static>
  </interactive>

</section>
